  'sassa-december-grant-payment-dates-confirmed-2026-11-06',
  'SASSA grants will be paid from 2 December, with a reminder to answer review notices',
  'Community', '2026-11-06', 'Cape Town ETC', 'https://www.capetownetc.com/news/sassa-confirms-december-grant-dates-and-review-warning/',
  'Older persons grants are paid on 2 December, disability grants on 3 December and children''s grants on 4 December, and recipients under review must respond to notices.',
  'Social grant recipients in Cape Town and across the country can expect their December payments in the first week of the month, according to dates SASSA confirmed in a media statement issued on 28 October.

Older persons and war veterans grants are due on Wednesday, 2 December. Disability grants follow on Thursday, 3 December, and children''s grants, including the child support, foster and care dependency types, are paid on Friday, 4 December. Grant-in-aid is paid together with the grant it supports. The dates published earlier in the year in SASSA''s annual schedule list the same three days for December.

The shifted dates seen in November were a one-off linked to the local government elections and do not carry over into December, according to the report.

SASSA also warns that people whose grants are under review must respond to official notices and send the requested information and supporting documents before the stated deadline. Failing to respond can lead to payment being suspended. Beneficiaries are advised to check their grant status directly with SASSA instead of relying on an SMS, and to keep their address, cellphone number, marital status and financial details up to date so that review requests do not go unseen.',
  NULL, NULL, NULL,
  '["https://www.capetownetc.com/news/sassa-confirms-december-grant-dates-and-review-warning/", "https://www.citizen.co.za/southern-courier/news-headlines/local-news/2026/07/08/sassa-releases-2026-2027-grant-payment-schedule/"]',
  'agent'
);
